self.KB_CONTENT["card:792346"]={"id":"card:792346","ty":"card","sourceId":"792346","title":"『借支申請單建立作業』中的『確認碼 (TE015)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"申請單","keywords":["申請單","作廢"],"y":"other","answer":"* 隱藏不可輸入，僅顯示圖示「核」或「廢」字。* (Y.已確認、N.未確認、V.作廢)。新增時預設N。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
